  <diagram id="k3s-evidence" name="Evidence and notation">
    <mxGraphModel page="1" pageWidth="1160" pageHeight="1000" background="#f5f5f5">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="evidence-text" value="&lt;h1&gt;Evidence and Kubernetes notation&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Converted from docs/architecture-diagram/k3s-architecture.html. This is the source’s 2026-09-18 snapshot, not a fresh live-cluster inspection.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Native Kubernetes icons: ING (Ingress), SVC (Service), POD, DEPLOY (Deployment), RS (ReplicaSet), CM (ConfigMap), VOL (Volume), Node and Control Plane. Traefik uses an ingress-role icon; it is the controller, distinct from the Glance Ingress resource.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Evidence and scope&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Read-only snapshot: 2026-09-18, approximately 10:23 UTC. Based on the Glance manifests, Ansible inventory, live Kubernetes resources, Piloma’s Caddyfile and Pi-hole DNS. Uses the existing homelab architecture JSON as the infrastructure reference and the existing light diagram palette. This engineer-focused, fit-sized SVG expands application routing; NAS, Jellyfin storage and the unused SDN remain in the original homelab overview.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Traefik returned HTTP 200; Caddy returned HTTP/2 200 with a forced hostname and diagnostic certificate verification bypass. Normal curl on Piloma did not trust the Caddy CA. Pi-hole still resolved Glance to .200, so the Caddy route requires correcting DNS to .14 or a client override. No infrastructure changes were made.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The live Caddy Glance block is inside Jellyfin’s managed markers. The legacy catch-all still targets 127.0.0.1:32759 with no observed listener. The Pi node record is NotReady, outside the intended three-VM cluster. These are documented discrepancies, not implied fixes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;DNS is distinct from web traffic. Ingress configures Traefik; Deployment and ReplicaSet manage Pods. The Service shows the logical backend relationship, not a guarantee that packets traverse its virtual IP. ConfigMaps become separate read-only volume projections in each Pod. Pod IPs, ReplicaSet name and placement can change.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Architecture and evidence · Glance runbook · Standalone SVG&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Authoring source: this HTML. Extract its single SVG to reproduce the vector artifact. System sans/serif fonts are intentional for offline rendering; appearance varies slightly with installed fonts. No external assets or scripts are required.&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=16;fontColor=#2d3142;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="40" width="1080" height="900" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>